section.mermaid:
flowchart TD
  D[ticket-set.draft] --> C0{schema}
  C0 -- fail --> R400[validator.refused 400 schema]
  C0 --> C1{anchor at repo_sha is current on main}
  C1 -- moved --> R1[validator.refused 422 anchor_moved]
  C1 --> C2{files: declared, no aggregate, no runtime path, disjoint inside the set, at most 6}
  C2 -- fail --> R2[validator.refused 422 files]
  C2 --> C3{records: input and output kinds exist in the registry}
  C3 -- fail --> R3[validator.refused 422 records]
  C3 --> C4{depends_on: keys resolve, ids exist, acyclic with existing tickets}
  C4 -- fail --> R4[validator.refused 422 depends]
  C4 --> C5{size: files and diff estimate within limits; one concern}
  C5 -- fail --> R5[validator.refused 422 size]
  C5 --> C6{duplicate: no accepted ticket on the same node with the same files}
  C6 -- fail --> R6[validator.refused 422 duplicate]
  C6 --> C7[run every acceptance command on main, record observed exit]
  C7 -- cannot run --> R7[validator.refused 422 acceptance with the command]
  C7 --> M[mint ids, put ticket records and ticket-set.accepted 201]
